   "text": "Adaptive behaviour (judge checklist):\n'structuring in last 30 days' ->\n  time filter + hybrid detect, EDA skipped\n'10+ txns under $10,000?' ->\n  aggregation only \u2014 no ML invoked\n'Is ACC4521 suspicious?' ->\n  entity lookup + on-demand score",
   "originalText": "Adaptive behaviour (judge checklist):\n'structuring in last 30 days' ->\n  time filter + hybrid detect, EDA skipped\n'10+ txns under $10,000?' ->\n  aggregation only \u2014 no ML invoked\n'Is ACC4521 suspicious?' ->\n  entity lookup + on-demand score",
